# Monstrosity (otherAreas 34): Pashhow Marshlands' Suspicious Hume (script: nothing until completed, then 45), Northern
# San d'Oria's Suspicious Elvaan (script: gladiatorOnTrigger: CHATTER 881 until completed, then GLADIATOR_INTRO 886),
# the Feretory's zone-in. ENABLE_MONSTROSITY 1; ENABLE_SOA / ENABLE_ROV 0 (their city cutscenes). A Lizard Tail.
# Available: the Elvaan: no section: 881 (the script); the tail traded: no section, the script has no onTrade: nothing.
# The Hume: the tail traded: nothing. The Hume 40, finished: begun. The Hume, no ring: 41 (priorityEvent). The Elvaan, no ring: 882 (INTRO, Progress);
# again: 882 (no fallback turn). The tail traded: MONSTROSITY_UNLOCK 43 (LIZARD), 883 (926), finished: the local
# cleared, the tail taken (tradeComplete), the Ring of Supernal Disjunction, setMonstrosityData(43, 43). The Elvaan, the
# ring: 884 (HAS_RING). The Hume, the ring: 42. The Feretory (a warp; its zone-in left open): the quest's onZoneIn: 2;
# updated with option 1: updateIntroEvent (race, face, the Lizard's starter); finished: completed (no reward). The
# Feretory's zone-in made the char a monster (MON): the completed section is #completed's.
lists PashhowMarshlands/Suspicious_Hume/onTrigger PashhowMarshlands/onEventFinish/40 NorthernSanDoria/Suspicious_Elvaan/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Suspicious_Elvaan/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/883 Feretory/onZoneIn/1 Feretory/onEventUpdate/2 Feretory/onEventFinish/2
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=83.7,-0.2,42.7 job=WAR lvl=75
setting ENABLE_MONSTROSITY 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
item LizardTail
login
trigger Suspicious_Elvaan               # available: no section; the script: 881 (CHATTER)
finish
trade Suspicious_Elvaan LizardTail x1   # available: no section; the script has no onTrade: nothing
warp -490.3,25,-618.6 PashhowMarshlands
trade Suspicious_Hume LizardTail x1     # available: no trade handler; the script has no onTrade: nothing
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # available: 40
finish                                  # begun
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # accepted, no ring: 41
finish
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # 41 again (the script does nothing before completion: no fallback event)
finish
warp 83.7,-0.2,42.7 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Suspicious_Elvaan               # no ring: 882
finish
trigger Suspicious_Elvaan               # 882 again (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish
trade Suspicious_Elvaan LizardTail x1   # MONSTROSITY_UNLOCK 43; 883 (926)
finish                                  # the tail taken; the ring; setMonstrosityData(43, 43)
trigger Suspicious_Elvaan               # the ring: 884
finish
trigger Suspicious_Elvaan               # 884 again (Progress: no fallback turn)
finish
warp -490.3,25,-618.6 PashhowMarshlands
trigger Suspicious_Hume                 # the ring: 42
finish
warp -358,-3.4,-440 Feretory open       # the quest's onZoneIn: 2, left open
update 2 option=1                       # updateIntroEvent: race, face, the starter
finish                                  # completed
